My last trip to the castle, I didn't have to fight the
soldiers in the barracks until after I had the wand. Kill
the fish with rocks, plug the moat with a /oCold or ?oEarth,
blast the drawbridge with a /oStrike or the force bolt spell
and go back into the maze to fight them one at a time on a
preprepared burned Elbereth. Have a /oSleep, !oSleep or
!oParalysis handy if someone fires a dangerous wand from
close range.

